    Projects\ManyDaughters\ManyDaughters_DataPreprocessing/data/derived_confi
    > dential/95%-sample/h3_dataset.dta saved

. 
. 
. * ============================
. * Regression
. * ============================
. 
. ivregress 2sls diff_kids_hours (has_daughters = firstkid_female) ///
> male age education_totalyears logincome i.migback i.partner years_since_first
> kid, cluster(hid)

